{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o019a","title":"袁谭袁绍迎刘备","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o019a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"袁谭率步骑迎刘备至平原，袁绍出邺二百里相见；刘备驻月余，散失士卒逐渐归集。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o019a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"投袁收众","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o019a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0163","role":"迎接","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o019a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0052","role":"迎接","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o019a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"平原、邺","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o019a-q"]},"time":{"year":200,"label":"刘备败走青州后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y200","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o018","basis":"刘备败走青州后"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o019a-q","xianzhu-q-o018","xianzhu-q-b-48b6a5909923ebbdbdcf"]},"source_order":[32,91,"O019a"],"order":6524}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0052","name":"袁绍","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0163","name":"袁谭","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o019a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-428d14a1d202fb9156c7","layer":"original","quote":"青州刺史袁谭，先主故茂才也〖1〗；将步骑迎先主，先主随谭到平原。谭驰使白绍，绍遣将道路奉迎；身去邺二百里〖2〗，与先主相见。﹝一﹞驻月余日〖3〗，所失亡士卒稍稍来集〖4〗。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":90,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-48b6a5909923ebbdbdcf","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-48b6a5909923ebbdbdcf","layer":"modern","quote":"〖9〗五年：建安五年（公元 200）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":83,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8b68ef31f073da72a52f","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o018","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-ad5eaaeb0ac8302cb92c","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖9〗，曹公东征先主，先主败绩。﹝五﹞曹公尽收其众，虏先主妻子；并擒关羽以归。先主走青州。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
